Article 2 (Applicability to restrictions on special promotion appointments)
(1) The amended provisions of this Decree regarding restrictions on special promotion appointments, honorary promotion (limited to military personnel), or special appointment (limited to foreign service officials in the class of councilor) due to disciplinary action shall also apply to persons who were subject to disciplinary action before this Decree enters into force.
(2) Any person who has been subject to a minor disciplinary action on the ground of sexual harassment under subparagraph 3d of Article 2 of the National Human Rights Commission of Korea Act before this Decree enters into force shall be deemed to have been subject to a minor disciplinary action on the ground of sexual harassment defined in subparagraph 2 of Article 3 of the Framework Act on Gender Equality in accordance with the amended provisions of this Decree.
