The amended provisions of this Decree relating to the revocation of special promotion appointments, honorary promotion (limited to military personnel), or special appointment (limited to foreign service officials in the class of councilor) resulting from the recovery of honorary retirement allowances shall begin to apply to persons appointed through special promotion after this Decree enters into force.

