ADDENDA <Presidential Decree No. 33361, Mar. 28, 2023>
Article 1 (Enforcement date)
This Decree shall enter into force on March 31, 2023.
Article 2 (Applicability to restriction on promotion appointment)
The amended provisions of Article 6(1)5 shall apply as follows:
1. Where a promotion appointment is made from deputy fire chief to fire chief: The amended provisions shall begin to apply to cases where such promotion appointment is made after this Decree enters into force;
2. Where a promotion appointment is made from fire captain to deputy fire chief: The amended provisions shall begin to apply to cases where such promotion appointment is made after this Decree enters into force;
3. Where a promotion appointment is made from fire lieutenant to fire captain: The amended provisions shall begin to apply to cases where such promotion appointment is made after January 1, 2026.
Article 3 (Applicability to education and training ratings)
The amended provisions of Article 10(1)2 and (2)2 shall begin to apply to cases where education and training ratings are made after January 1, 2026 (limited to cases where such ratings are made for the rank of fire lieutenant).
Article 4 (Special cases concerning education and training ratings)
Notwithstanding the amended provisions of Article 10(1)2 and (2)2, education and training rating scores for the rank of fire lieutenant shall be rated as follows until December 31, 2025: 3 points for Specialized Education and Training rating, 4 points for On-the-Job Training rating, 5 points for Physical Fitness Assessment rating, and 3 points for Professional Competency rating.

